   "linuxserver": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-tautulli/compare/develop-bf4deaa7-ls11...develop-5d7322c3-ls12",
   "upstream": "Fix absolute tar member test on Windows\n\nThe test built the member name from str(target). On Windows that name\nstarts with a drive letter. data_filter refuses a drive letter, so\nsafe_extract raised and the test failed. The test now uses a\nroot-absolute name with no drive letter, which works on every OS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
